  "invariants": [
    "Only two consecutive spill-to-spill moves in one edge may pair; no IR or block boundary is crossed.",
    "Source and destination offsets are each consecutive by8; first offsets fit signed7 scaled8 pair addressing (maximum504).",
    "The first destination cannot alias the second source; any edge use of allocator scratch physical17 disables pairs for that entire edge.",
    "All64 bits are copied for integer, narrow and floating kinds, matching the existing spill move.",
    "Frames, explicit stack offsets, operation counts and ordered symbolic fixup identities are unchanged; no function grows."
  ],
